{"id":"c2477c8e1bc04c16","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-symplectic.md","title":"Symplectic Form","display":"df-symplectic — Symplectic Form","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-symplectic","aliases":["58-df-symplectic","Symplectic Form"],"display":"df-symplectic — Symplectic Form","depends_on":["[[58-df-smooth-manifold]]","[[58-df-differential-form]]","[[58-df-tangent-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-symplectic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-symplectic</span><span>Symplectic Form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-symplectic — Symplectic Form"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"58-df-smooth-manifold\">58-df-smooth-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"db62358c2ba471b0\" href=\"?note=db62358c2ba471b0\" title=\"58-df-differential-form\">58-df-differential-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cd9981d8428c2629\" href=\"?note=cd9981d8428c2629\" title=\"58-df-tangent-space\">58-df-tangent-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\omega\\in V\">\\(M,\\omega\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(M)\\)</span> (smooth-manifold predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"58-df-smooth-manifold\">58-df-smooth-manifold</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\omega,M,n,2)\">\\(\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\omega,M,n,2)\\)</span> (differential-form predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"db62358c2ba471b0\" href=\"?note=db62358c2ba471b0\" title=\"58-df-differential-form\">58-df-differential-form</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_p M\">\\(T_p M\\)</span> (tangent space at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Symplectic}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Symplectic}_S\\)</span> (symplectic-form predicate defined in this file)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HamiltonianVectorField}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{HamiltonianVectorField}_S\\)</span> (Hamiltonian-vector-field predicate defined in this file)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}symplectic} \\vdash \\operatorname{Symplectic}_S(M,\\omega)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(M)\\land\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\omega,M,n,2)\\land d\\omega=0\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v\\in T_pM\\;\\bigl((\\forall w\\in T_pM\\;(\\omega_p(v,w)=0))\\to v=0\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}symplectic} \\vdash \\operatorname{Symplectic}_S(M,\\omega)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(M)\\land\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\omega,M,n,2)\\land d\\omega=0\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v\\in T_pM\\;\\bigl((\\forall w\\in T_pM\\;(\\omega_p(v,w)=0))\\to v=0\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}symplectic\\text{-}volume} \\vdash \\operatorname{Symplectic}_S(M,\\omega)\\land\\dim(M)=2n\\to\\Bigl(\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\tfrac1{n!}\\omega^{\\wedge n},M,2n,2n)\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\bigl((\\tfrac1{n!}\\omega^{\\wedge n})_p\\neq0\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}symplectic\\text{-}volume} \\vdash \\operatorname{Symplectic}_S(M,\\omega)\\land\\dim(M)=2n\\to\\Bigl(\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\tfrac1{n!}\\omega^{\\wedge n},M,2n,2n)\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\bigl((\\tfrac1{n!}\\omega^{\\wedge n})_p\\neq0\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}symplectic\\text{-}hamiltonian\\text{-}vector\\text{-}field} \\vdash \\operatorname{HamiltonianVectorField}_S(X_f,f,M,\\omega)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Symplectic}_S(M,\\omega)\\land f\\in C^\\infty(M,\\mathbb R)\\land X_f\\in\\prod_{p\\in M}T_pM\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v\\in T_pM\\;(\\omega_p(X_f(p),v)=d f_p(v))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}symplectic\\text{-}hamiltonian\\text{-}vector\\text{-}field} \\vdash \\operatorname{HamiltonianVectorField}_S(X_f,f,M,\\omega)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Symplectic}_S(M,\\omega)\\land f\\in C^\\infty(M,\\mathbb R)\\land X_f\\in\\prod_{p\\in M}T_pM\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v\\in T_pM\\;(\\omega_p(X_f(p),v)=d f_p(v))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Hamiltonian-vector-field clause fixes the sign convention <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_{X_f}\\omega=df\">\\(\\iota_{X_f}\\omega=df\\)</span>; some references use its negative.</li>\n<li>Symplectic form: closed nondegenerate 2-form; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim M\">\\(\\dim M\\)</span> must be even.</li>\n<li>Darboux: all symplectic manifolds are locally <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^{2n}\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^{2n}\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega = \\sum dp_i \\wedge dq_i\">\\(\\omega = \\sum dp_i \\wedge dq_i\\)</span></li>\n<li>Hamiltonian dynamics: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{x} = H_H(x)\">\\(\\dot{x} = H_H(x)\\)</span> preserves <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span></li>\n<li>Arnold conjecture: number of fixed points of Hamiltonian diffeomorphism <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\geq\">\\(\\geq\\)</span> Betti numbers</li>\n<li>Gromov-Witten: holomorphic curves in symplectic manifolds; used for quantum cohomology</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Arnold, Mathematical Methods of Classical Mechanics</li>\n<li>McDuff and Salamon, Introduction to Symplectic Topology</li>\n<li>Cannas da Silva, Lectures on Symplectic Geometry</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-smooth-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-smooth-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-differential-form","status":"resolved","id":"db62358c2ba471b0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-differential-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tangent-space","status":"resolved","id":"cd9981d8428c2629","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tangent-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-smooth-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":